<Defs>
	<!-- ============================ Nephila Vanilla Head  ========================== -->
	<AlienRace.ThingDef_AlienRace ParentName="BasePawn">
		<defName>NephilaVH</defName>
		<label>nephila</label>
		<description>A baseline Nephila. A product of a failed experiment attempting to create adaptive sex slaves using self replicating nanites, Nephila are gelatinous humanoids forced into a complex reproductive cycle by the failsafe mechanisms imbued into the nanites that have infested them. A base level Nephila is incapable of violence and wayed down by their exaggerated assets, but lays the Cherubim eggs that serve as a foundation for Nephila biology and have greater mobility than other Nephila forms. They come into being when a nephila cherubim core is implanted in a humanoid womb or when a humanoid woman comes into contact with one of the original conversion devices.</description>
		<comps>
			<li Class="Nephila.CompProperties_NephilaMilkableHumanoid">
				<milkDef>CoalescingCherubim</milkDef>
				<ticksUntilMilking>300000</ticksUntilMilking>
				<!--<ticksUntilMilking>300</ticksUntilMilking>-->
